    VSCode: 1.134.0 - C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Programs\Microsoft VS Code\bin\code.CMD
  npmPackages:
    @playwright/test: 1.63.0 => 1.63.0 
    playwright-core: ^1.43.0 => 1.63.0
```

